                <pb facs="0598" n="518" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg518"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            Leishman.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-06-18"><hi rendition="#italic">June 18,
                        1901</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hay acknowledges the preceding telegram, and extends cordial congratulations
                    to Mr. Leishman on the settlement of the indemnity claims, and directs that the
                    amount be remitted to the Department.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
